L0501: Cannot load source module

A declared module file is missing, ambiguous, cyclic, unreadable, or beyond a resource limit. Use exactly one of child.lc and child/mod.lc. Directory entries require export.lc.

The filesystem regression is `tests/fixtures/project-errors/L0501`. Its `export.lc` reproduces this category through the actual project pipeline.

```rust
mod absent;
```

Language, as built: [1.28:2](../spec/17-modules.md).
